</ul>

<h2 id="b2b">B2B events: Transaction Innovation Forum</h2>
<p>Michael Salmony is co-creator and chairman, with Harry Smorenberg, of the Transaction Innovation Forum (TIF), the B2B forum on payments, treasury and trade. No commercial messages: a full day of plenary sessions, expert break-outs and invitation-only round tables. The inaugural forum took place on 20th November 2023 at the Tokyo American Club, with simultaneous Japanese/English interpretation. The second annual APAC Transaction Innovation Forum followed in Tokyo on 5th September 2024 with a focus on risk and security.</p>
<p>Typical topics: operational excellence in cross-border B2B payments, cash and treasury management innovation, CBDC, ISO 20022, implementing Open Finance and Open Banking, trade finance, digital identity, security, and regulatory developments.</p>
